  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "施工法",
    "sub_ename": "CONSTRUCTION  METHODS",
    "describe_ch": "建立學生對於建築工程施工項目的整體性觀念，瞭解各工程項目的施工重點以及檢核查察的要點。並分析施工作業未來的發展趨勢與職涯的掌握重點。課程以工地現場實務性為主要規畫，輔以大量的施工案例說明，務期在課程內建立工地查核的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Establish students' overall concept of construction projects, understand the construction focus of each project and the main points of inspection. And analyze the future development trend of construction operations and the focus point of career mastery.The course takes site practicality as the main plan, supplemented by a large number of construction case descriptions, and create the ability for site project checking work during the course.",
